{"Title":"An Act relative to tow lien reform","BillNumber":"H3698","DocketNumber":"HD385","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"KNF1","Name":"Kimberly N. Ferguson","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KNF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-06T13:32:38.483"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"KNF1","Name":"Kimberly N. Ferguson","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/KNF1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-06T13:32:38.4833333"},{"Id":"FJB1","Name":"F. Jay Barrows","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/FJB1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-01T12:41:38.07"},{"Id":"DFD1","Name":"David F. DeCoste","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DFD1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T07:59:58.3833333"},{"Id":"RME1","Name":"Rodney M. Elliott","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/RME1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-28T15:45:15.0433333"},{"Id":"PKF1","Name":"Paul K. Frost","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/PKF1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-03T11:06:02.0333333"},{"Id":"SSH1","Name":"Steven S. Howitt","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SSH1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T16:35:30.1533333"},{"Id":"HEK1","Name":"Hannah Kane","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/HEK1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-30T15:38:58.36"},{"Id":"JDM1","Name":"Joseph D. McKenna","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JDM1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-27T20:35:56.9666667"},{"Id":"MOM0","Name":"Michael O. Moore","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MOM0","ResponseDate":"2023-03-15T11:52:16.96"},{"Id":"DKM1","Name":"David K. Muradian, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DKM1","ResponseDate":"2023-02-06T10:10:10.8466667"},{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-31T12:54:41.36"},{"Id":"MJS3","Name":"Michael J. Soter","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MJS3","ResponseDate":"2023-01-30T10:33:55.1066667"},{"Id":"SLG1","Name":"Susannah M. Whipps","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SLG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-26T20:09:59.33"},{"Id":"JDZ1","Name":"Jonathan D. Zlotnik","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JDZ1","ResponseDate":"2023-03-01T13:03:48.7"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3698/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Ferguson of Holden, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3698) of Kimberly N. Ferguson and others relative to tow lien reform.  Telecommunications, Utilities and Energy.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 6B of chapter 159B of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the word “authority,” in line 4, the following words:- or removed from a private way or property pursuant to section 120D of chapter 266.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 6B of said chapter 159B, as so appearing, is hereby amended by inserting the following after the word “way”, in line 17, the following words:- or pursuant to removal from a private way or property.\r\n\tSECTION 3. Section 39A of chapter 255 of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking out the words “removed from the scene of an accident”, in lines 1 and 2, and inserting in place thereof the following words:- involuntarily towed or transported pursuant to section 6B of chapter 159B.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J37","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J37"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Place in OD","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H52","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H52"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}